{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"d7a0000000000000","type":"text","x":0,"y":-400,"width":2510,"height":250,"text":"# 图的基本结构、路径与遍历\n\n**读图方式：** 先声明 vertex/edge 语义与图类型，再选表示；随后沿 walk → path → distance → connectivity 建立数学语言，最后进入共享搜索不变量、BFS 与 DFS。右上角是线性代数接口。\n\n点击卡片标题进入中英双语原子。青色表示基础定义、定理与代数接口，紫色表示需要主动区分的结构，绿色表示搜索程序，红色表示 cycle 诊断；颜色不表示掌握度。属性另见 [[知识原子.base|知识原子 Base]]。"},
		{"id":"d7a0000000000001","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":430,"height":270,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[图模型语义|Graph modeling]]\nVertices represent objects; edges represent a chosen relationship. State object identities, edge criteria and the question before using the graph.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n顶点表示对象，边表示选定关系。使用图之前，先说清对象身份、连边条件与问题目标。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"d7a0000000000002","type":"text","x":520,"y":0,"width":430,"height":270,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[图类型的建模边界|Graph types]]\nSpecify direction, parallel edges, loops and weights. Incidence-matrix reference arrows choose signs; they do not impose one-way travel.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n方向、平行边、自环与权重须分别约定。关联矩阵的参考箭头只选符号，不限制无向边的行进方向。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"d7a0000000000003","type":"text","x":1040,"y":-80,"width":430,"height":270,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[度数、入度与出度|Vertex degrees]]\nDegree counts edge ends. An undirected loop counts twice. Directed in-degree counts arrivals and out-degree departures; a directed loop adds one to each.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n度数数边端点，无向自环计二。有向入度数进入边，出度数离开边；有向自环各计一。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"d7a0000000000004","type":"text","x":1560,"y":-80,"width":430,"height":270,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[无向图握手定理|Handshaking lemma]]\nEvery edge in a finite undirected graph contributes two ends, including loops. Thus the degree sum is twice the edge count, and an even number of vertices have odd degree.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限无向图每条边贡献两个端点，自环也计二。因此度数和为边数两倍，奇度顶点个数为偶数。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"d7a0000000000005","type":"text","x":0,"y":310,"width":430,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[邻接表与邻接矩阵|Graph representations]]\nLists store vertices and outgoing edge records; a full matrix stores every vertex pair. Entries may encode existence, counts or weights. Choose the encoding before interpreting operations.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n邻接表存顶点与出边记录，完整矩阵存每对顶点。元素可以表示存在性、边数或权重；解释运算前先选定编码。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"d7a0000000000006","type":"text","x":520,"y":310,"width":430,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[邻接矩阵幂计数游走|Matrix powers and walks]]\nUse edge-count entries, one per loop. For a finite graph, $(A^k)_{ij}$ counts length-$k$ walks from $i$ to $j$; repetitions are allowed and $A^0=I$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限图以边数为元素、自环计一次；$(A^k)_{ij}$ 数 $i$ 到 $j$ 的长 $k$ 游走，允许重复，$A^0=I$。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"d7a0000000000014","type":"text","x":1040,"y":310,"width":430,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[图同构的定义与不变量|Graph isomorphism]]\nAn isomorphism of simple undirected graphs bijects all vertices, preserving edges and nonedges. It certifies the same connections after relabeling; drawing positions do not matter.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n简单无向图的同构将全部顶点双射配对，保留有边与无边。重命名后连接相同，图画位置不影响结果。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"d7a0000000000015","type":"text","x":1560,"y":310,"width":430,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[关联矩阵势差映射|Incidence matrix]]\nChoose reference arrows for a finite loopless undirected graph. Each edge row of $A$ has $-1$ at its tail, $+1$ at its head, and zeros elsewhere. Then $Ax$ gives head-minus-tail node values.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限无向无自环图任选参考箭头；$A$ 每边一行，起点 $-1$、终点 $+1$，其余为零。$Ax$ 给出终点值减起点值。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"d7a0000000000016","type":"text","x":2080,"y":310,"width":430,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[加权图 Laplacian|Weighted graph Laplacian]]\nWith nonnegative weights in the diagonal matrix $C$, $L=A^TCA$ maps node values back to nodes. Vectors in its kernel are constant on each component formed by positive-weight edges.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n将非负边权放入对角矩阵 $C$，$L=A^TCA$ 将节点值映回节点。核中的向量在每个由正权边连成的分量上分别为常数。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"d7a0000000000007","type":"text","x":0,"y":660,"width":430,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[游走路径与环|Walks, paths and cycles]]\nA walk follows edges and may repeat vertices or edges. A path repeats no vertex. A cycle has positive length, distinct edges, and no repeated vertex except its closing endpoint.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n游走沿边前进，允许重复顶点或边；路径不重复顶点。环长度为正、边互异，顶点除首尾闭合外不重复。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"d7a0000000000008","type":"text","x":520,"y":660,"width":430,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[游走去环得到路径|Removing closed detours]]\nDelete a closed segment between repeated visits to one vertex. This preserves endpoints and directions and reduces edge count. Repeat until no vertex repeats.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n删去两次到达同一顶点之间的闭合段，保留起终点与合法方向，并减少边数。重复至没有顶点重复。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"d7a0000000000009","type":"text","x":1040,"y":660,"width":430,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[图距离与可达性|Distance and reachability]]\nUnweighted distance is the fewest edges in a path: zero to oneself, infinity if unreachable. Directed distances need not be symmetric.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n无权距离是路径的最少边数：到自身为零，不可达为无穷。有向距离不必对称。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"d7a000000000000a","type":"text","x":1560,"y":660,"width":430,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[无向图连通分量|Connected components]]\nAn undirected component contains a vertex, every vertex reachable from it, and all their original internal edges. Its vertex set is an [[等价关系|equivalence class]].\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n无向分量收齐某顶点可达的全部顶点及它们之间的原有边；这个顶点集是一个[[等价关系|等价类]]。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"d7a000000000000b","type":"text","x":2080,"y":660,"width":430,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[强连通与弱连通|Strong and weak]]\nStrong components group mutually reachable vertices. Weak components ignore arrows. An outward search alone need not find a strong component.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n强分量按互相可达分组；弱分量忽略箭头。一次向外搜索得到的集合不一定是强分量。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"d7a000000000000c","type":"text","x":520,"y":1000,"width":430,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[搜索标记与父森林|Discovery and parents]]\nMark each new vertex before scheduling it, and retain its first parent. Parent edges form a forest; reverse a parent chain to recover a forward path.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n安排新顶点前先标记，并保留首次父记录。父边构成森林；将父链反向排列，才得到正向路径。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"d7a000000000000d","type":"text","x":1040,"y":1000,"width":430,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[邻接表图搜索复杂度|Search cost]]\nFull search costs $O(n+m)$ with adjacency lists, one scan per list and constant-time bookkeeping. Here $n$ counts vertices and $m$ counts edges.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n邻接表、每表扫描一次和常数成本的记录操作，给出全图搜索 $O(n+m)$；$n$ 是顶点数，$m$ 是边数。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"d7a000000000000e","type":"text","x":0,"y":1340,"width":430,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[BFS 分层与无权最短路|BFS distance layers]]\nA FIFO queue and marking on discovery give minimum edge-count distances. Equal positive edge costs preserve this objective; general weights need not.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\nFIFO 队列配合发现时标记，得到最少边数距离。同一正边权保留这个目标；任意权重不保证。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"d7a000000000000f","type":"text","x":520,"y":1340,"width":430,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[BFS 最短路树的顺序依赖|BFS parent trees]]\nEach reached non-root vertex keeps one parent in the previous distance layer. Ties may change this shortest-path tree without changing distances.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n每个已到达的非根顶点保留前一距离层的一个父顶点。并列候选可使这棵最短路树改变，而距离不变。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"d7a0000000000010","type":"text","x":1040,"y":1340,"width":430,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[DFS 可达性与非最短路径|Depth-first search]]\nFinish each new child before resuming its parent. Recursion or matching stack frames finds reachable vertices, without guaranteeing shortest paths.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n完成新子节点后，才恢复父节点。递归或等价栈帧可找到可达点，但不保证路径最短。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"d7a0000000000011","type":"text","x":1560,"y":1340,"width":430,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[有向 DFS 的环证书|DFS cycle test]]\nAn edge back to the active chain closes a directed cycle; a finished target alone is insufficient. Full DFS tests the entire graph.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n返回活动链的边闭合有向环；仅遇到已完成点不足以判环。完整 DFS 可检查整张图。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"d7a0000000000012","type":"text","x":2080,"y":1340,"width":430,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[无向 DFS 的父边例外|Parent-edge exception]]\nSkip the exact undirected edge that discovered the current vertex. A different parallel edge to its parent can form a two-edge cycle.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n跳过发现当前顶点的那条精确无向父边。通向父顶点的另一条平行边，可以组成两边环。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"d7a0000000000013","type":"text","x":1560,"y":1680,"width":430,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[全图搜索与强连通边界|Full graph search]]\nKeep old marks and restart at undiscovered roots. Undirected trees span components. Directed trees record new discoveries and need not match strong or weak components.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n保留旧标记，从未发现根重启。无向树覆盖各分量；有向树只记录本轮新发现点，不保证对应强或弱分量。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"u1-close-forest","type":"text","x":0,"y":2100,"width":950,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[关联矩阵与生成森林|Independent edges and spanning forests]]\nWith edges as real incidence rows, independence is equivalent to having no undirected cycle. A maximal independent edge set spans every connected component. If there are $n$ nodes and $c$ components, its $n-c$ rows form a basis of the row space.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实关联矩阵每边一行：独立行对应无环边集；极大独立边集才形成覆盖各分量的生成森林。$n$ 个节点、$c$ 个分量时，这 $n-c$ 行构成行空间的一组基。"},
		{"id":"u1-close-cycles","type":"text","x":1040,"y":2100,"width":950,"height":310,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[回路空间与守恒流|Cycle space and conserved flows]]\nWith $-1$ at each tail and $+1$ at each head, $A^Ty$ gives net inflow at every node. Without external injection, signed real flows with no accumulation satisfy $A^Ty=0$. For $m$ edges, $n$ nodes and $c$ components, this space has dimension $m-n+c$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n沿参考方向为正的实流量 $y$，经 $A^T$ 得到各节点净流入；无外部注入且无积累时 $A^Ty=0$。$m$ 条边、$n$ 个节点、$c$ 个分量时，回路空间维数为 $m-n+c$。"},
		{"id":"isomorphism-invariant-tests","type":"text","x":2080,"y":0,"width":430,"height":270,"color":"6","text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[图同构不变量的判别边界|Isomorphism invariant tests]]\nAn [[图同构的定义与不变量|isomorphism]] preserves the degree multiset. A mismatch rules it out; equal degrees alone do not certify it. Compare a six-cycle with two disjoint triangles.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n[[图同构的定义与不变量|同构]]保留度数多重集。不一致可以排除，同度数不能确认；六边形与两个不相交三角形就是反例。"}
	],
	"edges":[
